---
layout: base.njk
pageType: about
title: About the firm
description: A small roofing firm run by Will, covering west Wales, Swansea and Cardiff. One job at a time, quoted and worked by the same hands.
permalink: /about/index.html
---
{% set jobs = collections.jobs %}

<div class="wrap about-top">
  <div>
    <div class="eyebrow eyebrow-red">About the firm</div>
    <h1>Roofing in west Wales, one job at a time.</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ site.name }} is based on the border of Ceredigion and Pembrokeshire, with work spanning Carmarthenshire, Swansea and Cardiff. Re-roofs, new builds, flat and commercial work, historic slate and tile, and storm damage handled through insurance.</p>
    <p class="body">We keep the crew small on purpose. One job at a time means the roof gets stripped, felted, battened and covered by the same hands, and the site gets cleared before we leave.</p>
    <div class="stats">
      <div><div class="n txt">Same day</div><div class="l">Phone answered</div></div>
      <div><div class="n">{{ site.areasList.length }}</div><div class="l">Counties covered</div></div>
      <div><div class="n">1</div><div class="l">Person to deal with</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div>
    <div class="portrait"><span>portrait: {{ site.owner }} on site</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap founder">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">The founder</div>
      <h2>{{ site.owner }}</h2>
      <div class="role">Owner, and the man who quotes your roof</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="first">{{ site.owner }} served his time on slate roofs across west Wales before starting the firm. He quotes every job himself, works on all of them, and answers the phone.</p>
      <p>He'll tell you if a roof can be patched rather than replaced, and he'll tell you if it can't. Either way you get a written price with the materials listed, and no pressure to sign anything on the day.</p>
      <p>Roofing is the main business, but he takes on <a href="/carpentry/">carpentry</a> as well: timber framing, stud walls, staircases and fitted joinery.</p>
      <div class="about-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-red" href="tel:{{ site.phoneLink }}">Call {{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>
        <a class="btn btn-line" href="/contact/">Send an enquiry</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="wrap" style="padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:76px">
  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <div class="svc-lg">
    {% for s in site.services %}
    <div class="row"><div class="name">{{ s.name }}</div><div class="note">{{ s.note }}</div></div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
